authors:
  - family-names: Ulmer
    given-names: Ben
repository-code: "https://github.com/benwulmer/atlantic-diffusion"
url: "https://github.com/benwulmer/atlantic-diffusion"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Conditional diffusion downscaling of ECMWF SEAS5 seasonal forecasts over the
  North Atlantic. The model generates weather fields by adding a learned
  residual to an individual SEAS5 ensemble member, using ERA5 as the training
  target. This repository contains code for data acquisition, preprocessing,
  model training, and ensemble sampling. Input datasets and trained model
  weights are not included.
keywords:
  - diffusion models
  - seasonal forecasts
  - downscaling
  - North Atlantic
  - SEAS5
  - ERA5
